      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "An 86-year-old man presented at the Emergency Department with pain in his right leg and the inability to extend his knee after a fall. An ultrasound of the leg revealed a quadriceps tendon rupture. Surgical repair was performed and we expect complete recovery."},
